# ── MediaPipe pose bundles ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# lite + full are committed via Git LFS so a fresh clone is genuinely offline-
# capable (the PS requires a standalone offline system). 'heavy' is a 30 MB
# optional accuracy upgrade - fetch it on demand rather than paying for it in
# every clone:  python tools/fetch_pose_model.py --variant heavy
sih-har-isro/models/mediapipe/pose_landmarker_heavy.task

# ── SMPL body model — licensed, not ours to redistribute ─────────────────────
# The SMPL model file (basicmodel_neutral_lbs_10_207_0_v1.1.0.pkl) is
# distributed under a license that requires each user to register and accept
# its terms directly; it must not be redistributed via this repo. Every
# teammate downloads their own copy after accepting the license at
# https://smpl.is.tue.mpg.de/ and places it as documented in
# sih-har-isro/docs/HANDOFF_YOLO_MEDIAPIPE.md / hmr-env agent notes.
SMPL_NEUTRAL.pkl/
hmr_models/

