# ── Local run logs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# One pair of files per local pipeline run (timestamped); these are dev
# scratch, not a deliverable. The small evaluation result JSONs in
# sih-har-isro/logs/ (real_eval_*, t14_*, hmr_eval/) are NOT matched by this
# and stay tracked.
sih-har-isro/logs/experiment_log_*.txt
sih-har-isro/logs/experiment_log_*.jsonl

